          <h2 class="text-2xl font-black text-white mb-4">The Bottom Line</h2>
          <p class="text-gray-300 leading-relaxed mb-4">
            For most drivers, the NOCO Boost GB40 is the best car jump starter: rated for engines up to 6.0 liters gas, spark-proof and small enough for a glove box. Choose the NOCO GB150 or TOPDON JS3000 for trucks and diesels, the Hulkman Alpha Max for extreme cold, the GOOLOO A3 if you also want a tire inflator, the AstroAI S8 for the lightest pack, and the Clore Jump-N-Carry for a shop.
          </p>
          <p class="text-gray-300 leading-relaxed mb-4">
            Whatever you buy, shop by engine size rather than peak amps, recharge the pack every few months, and follow your vehicle's and the jump starter maker's instructions every time you connect it.
